odeSymlink, os.ModeDevice, os.ModeCharDevice, os.ModeSocket, os.ModeNamedPipe) combined with permission bits (0o111) for executable detection, matching the switch cases in fileTypeCode.\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"pkg/format/color_test.go exists and compiles without errors.\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go test ./pkg/format/... passes with all new color tests passing.\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"Tests cover FileTypeColor for all 8 file type categories: directory, symlink, executable regular, block device, character device, socket, named pipe, and non-executable regular file.\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"Tests verify that SetColorEnabled overrides automatic detection and ResetColorEnabled reverts to automatic behavior.\"\n```","stop_reason":null,"session_id":"9aaabb2a-a81d-4488-aa4c-42657a8247e1","total_cost_usd":0.780192,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":80650,"cache_read_input_tokens":19289,"output_tokens":10659,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":80650,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":10659,"cacheReadInputTokens":19289,"cacheCreationInputTokens":80650,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.780192,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"uuid":"d94e51c0-a7e9-41f2-8c78-354dcb3d6575"}
